<title>UK: LIFFE July coffee stocks rise to 4,657 lots-trade.</title>
<headline>LIFFE July coffee stocks rise to 4,657 lots-trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>LIFFE certified coffee stocks rose to 4,657 five-tonne lots in July from 2,346 lots in June, traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>This was marginally higher than expectations, they said. There was no immediate confirmation from LIFFE.</p>
<p>-- Jeremy Smith, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
